| Logistic regression baseline (or a suitable baseline, with rationale) | Met for B, not met for A | B: logistic regression on BCVA + CST, biomarkers, intensity. A: no logistic baseline yet; proposed logistic regression on age, sex, race (image-free features) to measure the added value of OCT |
| AUC + calibration (curve, in-the-large, slope) + Brier score, with 95% CIs | Not met | AUC available; CIs only for Branch B; no calibration or Brier score in either branch (biggest weakness, weeks 10–13) |
| Adequate sample size; applicability limitations | Not met (partial) | Limitations stated (C3); no Riley sample size calculation yet. FairVision test ≈ 261 positives (8.7% × 3,000), but only 16 positive Asian cases; OLIVES 87 patients |

## D. AI use declaration

Throughout the course of this project, we utilized AI tools such as ChatGPT and Claude to assist with tasks such as locating relevant literature, generating illustrative imagery, correcting errors in our writing, and processing information. Nevertheless, our team remained solely responsible for all key decisions, including the selection and preprocessing of datasets. Furthermore, we rigorously verified the information and materials provided by these AI tools to ensure the highest level of accuracy and reliability. We took great care to avoid incorporating incorrect information or unofficial sources; in particular, we independently validated our data to ensure that our findings were consistent with the results reported in the research papers that originally utilized these datasets.

| Tool | Used for | How the team verified it |
|---|---|---|
| ChatGPT, Claude | Locating relevant literature and summarizing it to build the 40-paper matrix | Every paper has a traceable DOI or link; DOI, authors, year and journal of #3–#6 checked via Crossref, abstract figures of #7–#9 checked against the publisher pages; A1 result counts are direct re-runs on PubMed. All A2 figures were checked against the full texts by the assigned members (A2) |
| ChatGPT, Claude | Generating illustrative images for slides | Used only as illustrations, never as data or evidence of results |
| ChatGPT, Claude | Correcting errors in writing; drafting progress reports | Each member reviewed the sections they are responsible for (see Members); every number in B1 and B2 must be traceable to a file in `results/` |
